# 一期仅上传 design-system-app；外部目录（DESIGN.md / script / data / assets / skills / index.html 等）待定后再放行
/*
!/.gitignore
!/design-system-app/
!/design-system-admin/
!/requirement/
!/README.md
!/mock-api/
!/test-zip/

# mock-api 运行产物不入库
mock-api/.pids/
mock-api/*.log

# test-zip 生成产物不入库（make_test_zips.py 可复现全部测试包）
test-zip/*.zip
test-zip/wrong-ext-design.md
